    dcterms:description "Athletes, coaches, technical officials, teams, events and medals of the Tokyo 2020 Olympic Games, converted from the Kaggle CSV dump (a 2021 snapshot) to 5-star Linked Open Data and validated against the Olympic LOD application profile (SHACL). Release 1.0.0; links to Wikidata from a snapshot retrieved on 2026-11-25."@en ;
    dcterms:issued "2026-11-25"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/> ;
    dcterms:source <https://olympics.com/tokyo-2020/olympic-games/en/results/>,
        <https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/piterfm/tokyo-2020-olympics> ;
    dcterms:title "Tokyo 2020 Olympic Games as Linked Open Data"@en .

